Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:07.74,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:10.18,HybridItalics,,0000,0000,0000,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:21.58,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:46.79,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The goddess dances with the void, \Ndeath, the Emperor, and eternity...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.33,0:00:59.53,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it true, Aldea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:03.20,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you really see Zeros on Lemuria?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.61,0:01:06.34,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I saw it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.15,0:01:09.64,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't you report that to the brass?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.64,0:01:13.32,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Because I wanted you to \Nget all the credit, Grabel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:14.99,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You're a fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:16.56,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,And one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:20.47,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That girl who was wearing Zeros\N called herself Aine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.14,0:01:28.55,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Then I suppose we'll have to\Ndo this ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.61,0:03:04.53,Episode,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,460)}Episode 7
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.61,0:03:04.53,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,460)}Imperial Hero -Grabel-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:03.03,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Initiating sealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:06.14,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Entrance Magitech signal is dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.14,0:03:09.67,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Ninety, seventy, fifty, thirty...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.67,0:03:14.44,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The Magitech particles \Nhave dropped by 99.999%.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.44,0:03:15.79,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The sealing is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:19.40,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,So the data was real?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:21.31,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,If we can seal the entrances,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:23.62,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,we can drastically alter \Nthe course of this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:26.48,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Now we have a way to make...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:28.81,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...the joint US-Japan operation \Nto retake Okinawa a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:34.60,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,But who sent this data to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:40.82,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe that\Nmy first time is with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:42.88,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,This should be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:46.62,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I just brought you to the cafeteria\Nbecause you wanted to try it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.62,0:03:47.98,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make it sound like something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.20,0:03:52.08,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,May we sit across from you, leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.49,0:03:54.92,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:03:58.12,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm never going to forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:02.48,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The leader of the Masters, Scarlet Fairchild.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:03.43,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.52,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Gertrude Baird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:07.55,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.55,0:04:10.31,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Sharon Cunningham.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:12.88,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:15.44,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We've joined the academy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:17.06,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,For the joint operation, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:23.57,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kizuna, I heard you \Nhave a special power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:27.35,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, it's nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.47,0:04:30.60,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Now I'm even more interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:32.00,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kizuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:34.83,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,can you show me around Ataraxia?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.95,0:04:38.27,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Since we're both the leaders \Nof our respective teams,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:40.12,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,we should get to know each other better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:43.37,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.37,0:04:47.23,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna has a lunch meeting with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.23,0:04:48.60,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Don't interrupt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:51.88,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,G-Give me a break...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.07,0:04:59.13,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.72,0:05:02.30,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:05.72,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.55,0:05:10.09,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Kizuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.09,0:05:12.97,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,we can't let this valuable afternoon\Ngo to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:16.40,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,The only thing going to waste \Nis all that fat in your boobs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.86,0:05:19.25,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:20.80,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We'll just have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:22.00,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,...fight for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:23.72,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,It's on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.90,0:05:32.32,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:23.32,HybridItalics,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,You guys are ballers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:26.32,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.49,0:06:29.32,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,We're just getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:37.96,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,So why are you having a swimsuit contest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.27,0:06:41.58,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,And am I even allowed to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:46.25,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:52.23,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:57.35,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,They're wearing the same swimsuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:07:00.16,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you copying me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:01.10,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,You're copying me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.27,0:07:08.54,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:09.99,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Come with me, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:13.02,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.12,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.12,0:07:27.50,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,My breasts may not be as big,\Nbut my proportions are better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:30.01,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you so obsessed with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:32.60,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, I'm interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:33.98,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.98,0:07:37.12,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Like, the whole Heart Hybrid thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:39.45,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,What's it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:42.81,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Want to try it with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:50.10,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.08,0:07:54.56,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:55.57,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:58.88,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:08.92,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,Is this a Heart Hybrid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.51,0:08:12.86,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:24.44,HybridMain,k,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, Yurishia, it was an accident...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:25.73,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.17,0:08:30.01,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,It was silly of me to get\Nworked up against a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.44,0:08:32.74,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:36.37,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make me say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:38.87,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:45.39,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Scarlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.39,0:08:46.38,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:50.17,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You and Yurishia are actually \Nfriends, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:51.02,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:53.60,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You were in perfect harmony \Nwhen you were dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:55.63,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,And you had basically\Nthe same taste in swimsuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:56.75,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.75,0:08:58.36,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.36,0:08:59.63,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Scarlet...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:03.89,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know what a \Nhorrible person Yurishia is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:06.44,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,She...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:10.72,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,She used us as pawns to be sacrificed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:12.15,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sacrificed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:14.54,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It was our first time...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:18.16,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...fighting a Dragorie,\Na Category-A Magitech weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.94,0:09:21.96,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,W-We can't fight this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:22.81,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Help—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:32.04,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Yurishia deliberately sent us on ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:33.70,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,to fight the Dragorie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:48.94,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,And after she made us wear it down,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:51.40,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,she took all the glory for herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:09:59.10,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm never going to forgive her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.10,0:10:01.26,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm never going to forgive Yurishia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:04.75,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe Yurishia would do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:06.88,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,She's not that type of person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:07.71,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:09.11,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:18.01,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You heard that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:19.41,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:23.05,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Is what she said true?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:26.41,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,If that's what she said, it probably is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.41,0:10:27.53,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yurishia...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.55,0:10:29.82,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:42.68,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,All hail the general!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:44.80,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,All hail the Empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.80,0:10:46.75,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,All hail the general!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.75,0:10:48.85,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,All hail the Empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.85,0:10:50.96,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,All hail the general!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:53.03,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,All hail the Empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.03,0:10:55.11,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,All hail the general!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:56.51,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,All hail the Empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:03.21,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,How dare she act like she's more \Nimportant than the Royal Guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.21,0:11:06.88,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,But I think we should just let her\Ndo what she wants for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:08.48,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,She's going to trip up eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:10.27,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.41,0:11:12.77,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.39,0:11:17.98,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You're getting too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:19.94,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with that? It's a celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:23.10,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:27.41,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,On days like this, it starts to throb.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:36.96,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,This scar you gave me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.55,0:11:40.09,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The same goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:43.92,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,A fragment of your spear is still within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:46.09,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Did it hurt? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.09,0:11:47.10,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:54.86,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Grabel...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.45,0:11:57.36,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.68,0:11:59.64,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:23.74,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Aldea...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:26.84,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:29.12,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get a battleship ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:30.89,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,One with a long range, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.76,0:12:33.51,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:36.94,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's get back to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:38.49,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:43.31,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,N-Now's not the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:46.38,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.53,0:12:49.40,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.40,0:12:50.63,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:53.66,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You're so mean, Grabel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.66,0:13:02.14,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Captain, I made this in Home Ec!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:04.93,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Please share it with everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:06.70,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.09,0:13:09.40,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:11.96,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you'll make a \Ngood wife someday, Sylvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.43,0:13:14.43,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,A-A wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:16.32,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, it's too sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:18.83,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm still not old enough to marry,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.83,0:13:20.81,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,but if it was with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.81,0:13:21.95,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:24.70,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.97,0:13:33.08,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.71,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't I find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.06,0:13:37.85,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,It's me I'm looking up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:47.09,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,The goddess dances with the void, \Ndeath, the Emperor, and eternity...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.62,0:13:50.12,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,What am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.84,0:13:54.66,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,There you are, Aine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:13:56.94,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.76,0:14:00.38,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm free to go wherever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:02.62,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.62,0:14:05.23,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sylvia made us some cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.23,0:14:06.22,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:07.18,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't need any.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:07.90,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:09.83,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:13.87,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You do need some.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.31,0:14:26.03,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Why aren't you saying anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:27.05,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:28.49,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.49,0:14:31.01,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,There's something you want to ask me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:36.57,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to ask about something\Nyou don't want to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:41.19,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,But, if you ever do want to talk about it,\Ncome straight to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.05,0:14:43.15,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:45.24,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:47.34,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.53,0:15:09.80,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Give me a sitrep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.25,0:15:11.92,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,How many enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:12.80,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:17.64,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It's a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:20.02,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It's a single, unarmed woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.72,0:15:24.60,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You, from the other dimension!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:27.11,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Surrender, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:30.78,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm impressed you were willing \Nto come here yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:32.79,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,but it was a stupid thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:33.88,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Bored now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.88,0:15:35.02,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Can I shoot her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.02,0:15:36.75,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Not yet, whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:39.93,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I am General Grabel,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.93,0:15:45.26,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Commander of the Batlantis Empire's \NLemuria Theater 6th Expeditionary Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.28,0:15:49.52,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I demand you hand over Zeros \Nand its Magitech knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:50.67,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.94,0:15:54.39,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Otherwise I cannot guarantee your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.39,0:15:58.05,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,What? Are you crazy, slut?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.05,0:16:00.52,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You're surrounded by the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.34,0:16:05.90,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Bite it, alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.42,0:16:16.52,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Negotiations failed, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:20.29,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,A-All units, engage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:23.84,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Zoros.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:32.06,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:39.97,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.85,0:16:44.01,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Gertrude? Sharon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.01,0:16:45.14,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:53.25,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:17:00.33,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Gertrude! Sharon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.95,0:17:03.20,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Deploy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:06.83,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! You can't just attack without a plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.08,0:17:08.23,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.45,0:17:25.98,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:28.14,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,It's so powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.34,0:17:44.39,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:47.85,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It's my fault this happened to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.85,0:17:49.37,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:50.26,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Where's everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:56.63,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Himekawa... Aine...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:17:59.01,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Both of you get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:01.72,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't let you handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:02.99,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Piss off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.99,0:18:04.92,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to fight with no ammo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:28.79,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:30.65,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.23,0:18:37.50,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Gunsword...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.47,0:18:40.91,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Raver.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.06,0:18:55.95,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You may be proud, Knight of Lemuria.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:59.24,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You made me use my Gunsword.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:04.71,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to hit you hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.71,0:19:05.70,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The Kuros, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.71,0:19:07.71,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.45,0:19:09.67,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.47,0:19:16.96,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,No way... She was able to stop\Na full-power attack from the Kuros?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.87,0:19:19.72,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:33.54,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:35.48,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:36.74,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:37.86,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:00.46,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.46,0:20:04.25,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take out a wimp like you with one hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:07.26,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.59,0:20:16.78,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:19.53,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let you touch Aine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:22.04,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:23.40,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.43,0:20:38.84,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Wiped out...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:40.65,HybridMain,Gu,0000,0000,0000,,Amaterasu has been wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.04,0:20:43.19,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:50.83,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:55.14,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.46,0:20:59.29,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to know, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.11,0:21:04.82,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.24,0:21:19.06,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,We'll see each other again, \Nmale Magitech knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:22.09,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Get the recovery teams out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.52,0:21:25.09,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry! No wasting time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.10,0:21:24.71,HybridOverlap,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,She let them go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:29.72,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:32.35,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm almost out of magic, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.35,0:21:36.46,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Being on Lemuria uses more \Nof my magic than anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.80,0:21:38.73,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.97,0:21:41.96,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Next time, I will succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.23,0:21:45.53,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,What was that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.81,0:21:50.09,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:54.29,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.04,0:23:40.06,Illustration,,0000,0000,0000,,Illustration: Yoshihiro Watanabe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.44,0:23:27.45,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I swear by the honor of Batlantis,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.45,0:23:28.94,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,and my pride as a soldier,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.94,0:23:30.65,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I shall have victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.65,0:23:33.42,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Grabel, let's take \Nup where we left off...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.42,0:23:34.93,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,And that Zeros...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:37.21,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're so silly, Grabel...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.14,0:23:40.06,Next Episode Title,,0001,0001,0160,,{\fad(900,1)}Connective Hybrid
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.21,0:23:38.86,HybridTop,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,S-Stop it, Aldea!
